"targetNotes":"页图上缘的题注与开篇段落。","sourceLabel":"第 51 页局部","sourceNotes":"第 51 页上半段题注，称此为“江干樵唱”并简述三章结构。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"题注"},{"key":"0001-2","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"南有喬木，不可休息。漢有游女，不可求思。漢之廣矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"第一章的开头与江景描写。","sourceLabel":"第 51-52 页","sourceNotes":"第 51-52 页开头段落与旁注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null},{"key":"0002-2","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"翹翹錯薪，言刈其楚。之子于歸，言秣其馬。漢之廣矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"第二章的樵人采薪与告白。","sourceLabel":"第 51-52 页","sourceNotes":"第 51-52 页中段对第二章的注释。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null},{"key":"0003-2","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"翹翹錯薪，言刈其蔞。之子于歸，言秣其駒。漢之廣矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"第三章续写“刈蔞”“秣駒”及江景收束。","sourceLabel":"第 51-52 页","sourceNotes":"第 52 页底段注释转入第三章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null},{"key":"0004-2","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":null}]}]}}}
